  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The gallery camera has zoom and position/crop functionality.\nThis displays fine in the preview, but once the photo is taken and mirrored, the position of the crop is not flipped, so the resulting image is cropped wrong.\n\nI do not know the correct term for positioning the preview image, so this post may be worded incorrectly. Linked a video clip as that will probably explain the issue better.\n\nhttps://youtu.be/3lBEjdRRMJI",
